<title>USA: NTL extends offers for 10, 13 pct notes.</title>
<headline>NTL extends offers for 10, 13 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NTL Inc said Thursday it is extending its offers for all outstanding 10 percent senior notes due 2007 in exchange for 10 percent Series B senior notes due 2007 and 13 percent senior redeemable exchangeable preferred stock in exchange for 13 percent Series B senior redeemable preferred stock.</p>
<p>It said the expiration date for the offers has been extended to June 30 and that all other terms in its May 27 prospectus remain in effect.</p>
</text>
